msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/troubleshooting/autostart-troubleshooting.rst:5
#: 2bcf11b5fac241ca802027c8378daeb6
msgid ""
"In several cases, there is a need to prevent ``autostart=True`` for qubes on "
"boot. For example:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/troubleshooting/autostart-troubleshooting.rst:7
#: be09840b2fbf43eb9433e909a6e5aa49
msgid ""
"``sys-usb`` was enabled, but the only keyboard is attached via USB, and the "
"``qubes.InputKeyboard`` service is disabled."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/troubleshooting/autostart-troubleshooting.rst:9
#: 1591d698d5c244989bc2f85786214fe3
msgid ""
"A PCI device assigned to an autostarting qube crashes the system (e.g., a "
"GPU or RAID controller card)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/troubleshooting/autostart-troubleshooting.rst:13
#: 5d9c9c3cafed40d4ac8c69d23acd8083
msgid ""
"To address this, there is a ``qubes.skip_autostart`` option for the kernel "
"command line. You can use it at the grub boot menu."
msgstr ""

